Track 1: Cicadas Hijack the Phase Box
- Story & Context: When police locked down the expressway on-ramp at the Ojota flyover, Femi jammed a copper chisel into the traffic control cabinet, rerouting the signal's electrical cycling directly into his drum sequencer to ignite the assembly. The pungent scent of vaporized electrical tape filled the night air as the crowd formed an impenetrable circle around the flashing amber junction box, locking into an eerie, four-beat mechanical gallop. A lone megaphone cut through the clattering zinc jingles as Femi chanted the track's rallying hook, "The green light lies, so we dance on the yellow."
